{
  "builtBy": "Read on 2026-11-14 from each school’s own athletics site or the page it links as its roster (readUrl), transformed by a script and checked against the page by hand: one entry per school whose site publishes a current-season JV girls volleyball roster.",
  "capturedAt": "2026-11-14",
  "notes": [
    "A school’s own JV list, transcribed as the school printed it: name, number, grade, position and height where the page gives them, null where it does not. Nothing is guessed. A name printed all in lower case or all in capitals is re-cased the way MaxPreps roster rows are (lib/sources/person-name.ts recaseName).",
    "The team page shows the fuller of this list and MaxPreps’ JV roster (data/volleyball/jv-rosters.json), each counted without the players on the varsity roster; the school’s own list on a tie (lib/jv/jv-rosters.ts).",
    "Grades come from the page’s grade or class word. A captain is marked only where the page marks one.",
    "Left out: MacDonald’s page (its Varsity column is MaxPreps’ 2025-26 varsity roster, 11 of 14, so the list is last season’s) and Ann Sobrato’s olinesports JV page (no season named; five of its twelve are on this season’s varsity roster and one was on last season’s).",
    "Not refreshed by any scheduled job. Re-read by hand; checkedOn says when each list was read."
  ],
